{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000038_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000038_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:978ff332a9ae59374cb0dc68e30ae95270e222ba41d69439058dc97ddf33ba9f", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 1, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "М-м…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000039_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000039_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:c1551268d007bcdcf44fbf1665bc4604daa9d4292190755aa9bf81b353727213", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 2, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я просыпаюсь от нехватки воздуха.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000040_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000040_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:0aedf5cf8b72ed9a012f558ca17666c5dbe3767e4881499bf999fef94266f528", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 3, "speaker": null, "translation": "Передо мной кто-то есть, но слишком близко, и лица не разглядеть.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000041_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000041_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:b0877eb309aafe781431b530931c799e872276550504c96defe7ce5e4535bf32", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 4, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я чувствую лишь сладкий запах молока.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000042_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000042_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:04b48f9f2ef6496106d3d71283aa29cd4b5f286864e255929a2c3f5d88789a82", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 5, "speaker": null, "translation": "Между нами появляется расстояние, и взгляд фокусируется.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000053_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000053_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:309efdcdd6cc472281e7915ec0af8f7f05a2885a86a24cc097800fd403d70c96", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 6, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "А? Что? Номики, почему…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000054_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000054_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:a9c4af530eea8ea01f72249a7220b3403d87efba01c3193bcddd2fbe2d9c08dd", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 7, "speaker": null, "translation": "Ещё мгновение назад я видел сон.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000055_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000055_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:6b0ff5a699012c977595b678cea09e5b4dfcaa79bc63624891b1d22f58801a7e", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 8, "speaker": null, "translation": "Как обычно, очень удобный для меня.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000056_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000056_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:f5f0b303bbe271e20151267c07db8253b654bb17a2f1dcd2ae913338a6ac3dc9", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 9, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я его помню.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000057_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000057_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:531ce4d72e352fb7b6acc25a860966cce83ce39e095956eabd4a018749e39755", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 10, "speaker": null, "translation": "Раз я проснулся, то теперь это реальность, верно?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000058_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000058_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:24fc315a17d84e8019f0b7539f6cb58956c1e75606ab65623a272ab1a682c8f0", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 11, "speaker": null, "translation": "Но почему тогда Номики здесь…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000061_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000061_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:941cd14435f08c3f493be62723f30fa9e6420b1352d6d245f3ec2c7966a2996f", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 12, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Что такое? Ещё не проснулся?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000062_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000062_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:848ca4d320f1ad04d00d4bf815ac0c332ea924218fcaad4d07a3936c24b6b4a9", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 13, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Э-э, ну… это…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000063_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000063_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:2bac1bb3b60136b663eb125a3af63d4806ab0216c00fb8231cbada9b88a307ef", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 14, "speaker": null, "translation": "Номики застенчиво улыбается.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000064_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000064_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:e7f7202f130beadfc02ffb56d129191d672c263bf566fd8d3109c4988cd89993", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 15, "speaker": null, "translation": "От её безмятежной улыбки я и сам чувствую счастье, и слова совсем не идут.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000065_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000065_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ad19a98c3dfd141d0b866cfb210a03e1e6b16a547acef97e88b244357a0532a4", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 16, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я осматриваюсь.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000066_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000066_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:2c775730456e5b2505980d27891d5d5dda171164e71ebbde77685b14788c5b6b", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 17, "speaker": null, "translation": "Раз я проснулся, должно быть утро, но вокруг ещё сумрачно.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000067_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000067_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:cdefa21931780f229950888f17f12ae7de4cbc25c23fb7fab9c2086724a7cf03", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 18, "speaker": null, "translation": "Что-то не так, как всегда.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000068_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000068_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:9fec4c3bf670877448b199944c2420e9d09f71c303bc8ab5a08a4b7c65c2a4e0", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 19, "speaker": null, "translation": "Что всё это значит?..", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000069_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000069_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:810f938ee3a0b076e41a5197767a364381bd838206d87068aa105c29f0cfb9d3", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 20, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Неужели я всё ещё сплю?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000072_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000072_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ebe435ce1d70cc4fd54ff0e3bf85f30aa75ab537fda2c4fad2058f467ccb36f9", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 21, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Спишь? О чём ты?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000075_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000075_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ee7a09c54f625939e8414ea0d196ff0b6b8fff01f245a9bb5aa02adf011b5cee", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 22, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Хотя такая счастливая жизнь и правда похожа на сон.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000076_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000076_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:8badbe3d57677c3ba1daa1927c80a6479fa70151c9b86951ecea384587baa77f", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 23, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Ты счастлива?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000079_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000079_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:59f44419d4155b8935af62e4c535593d12b61e20e809ac4a855018994d85f9f6", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 24, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Конечно.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000082_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000082_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:8c1ed27f0cfa5fd0c15c653dcfd881c2505a0fcd2d4a74324c2cfcb355b7ee6e", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 25, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "А ты нет?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000083_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000083_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:a00ee50a697554f59b2f26bae4507558aaaf53fdb735d8bbafd2cf1c968f6efa", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 26, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "А? Я…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000084_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000084_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:166c5f6f9dc95871ed382ef0aa99a4983aa0f84d11183e5c90e5ead1e45ef2a2", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 27, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Конечно…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000085_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000085_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:5273f96ca10b818b5202a04e31de3026d69e1de9e63c802e70920f29895e0658", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 28, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Я счастлив.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000088_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000088_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:3178822dcb2682999b47562d28dd1ee5357ae3e205c5b018ff0d5250fd84d79c", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 29, "speaker": null, "translation": "Номики так близко.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000089_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000089_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:56b8d32c61b1fd2a4a499897f21a0821c9aa16566b5747e87f1774ea3f1fd8d0", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 30, "speaker": null, "translation": "После такого счастливого пробуждения невозможно не быть счастливым.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000090_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000090_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:f4ae2e92080a659725b57f23dd020fc5884bd2a81ec573f6feee502cc9c75530", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 31, "speaker": null, "translation": "Но впервые и на второй день вокруг всё ещё ночь.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000091_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000091_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:4f810ed05e0c05d20bac086a41f3a1b9b111076f69032d9d8338fa04b3edd0fe", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 32, "speaker": null, "translation": "До сих пор, просыпаясь, я всегда возвращался в реальность, но судя по всему, сейчас я во сне.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000092_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000092_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:a7476bcef5c11ad61e3ea75d50a4ee0620b6485f6b3a04082d17d0bd9339bfdc", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 33, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "…Это… сон, верно? А?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000093_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000093_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:6f0aebad94ef4149c991951313e2d00d7ec496d62d29372e1720b81505eac8f1", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 34, "speaker": null, "translation": "Стоит перестать размышлять, и я уже не уверен, сон это или реальность.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000096_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000096_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:21afa7e8a45760657150f74368933c4ed41492d32f5bc1265ad20c75af51a8cc", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 35, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Почему это должно быть сном?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000097_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000097_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:e4e212bb343a8307018ab015ee7cbf6130ea3b86d48cdd7602e0537746ccfce3", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 36, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Потому что… нет… но…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000098_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000098_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:a8c8b238e55704e0b60165165b08054197ad3de7e6b57de75215a5a8a6348e43", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 37, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "С каких пор у нас такие отношения?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000101_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000101_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:8c050e0fcea9f9f2b6d5b2062b54228303bc193eb3229136f41dd0998c4009e3", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 38, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Ты ещё не проснулся?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000104_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000104_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:80d2a73dc0d01fa531c529a6e93e8af6aaa9f4704c07721c82dddfb3bb8bbda3", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 39, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Забыл, как признался мне в любви в первое лето после приезда на остров Торисиро?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000107_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000107_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:6e9d24c5ffdda2a03f40f9cc370074088b3c61b4831d959ac42e5d754ac85bd3", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 40, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Меня тоже привлекла твоя искренность.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000108_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000108_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:c18169a5a54c2cda0dc23bcb9b57867c1cae94ad60d3b792c5867206113d82b1", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 41, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "В-вот как…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000111_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000111_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:6915c982889df4d5d76bf1c4566663fbf9901b148db4183a68acf0d3a7a1b0a3", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 42, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "А через неделю… мы официально стали мужем и женой.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000112_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000112_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:9f0857829b2dc3244b55f9d4ded10117cb2939efe764bebde23d805a53df2863", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 43, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "……", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000113_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000113_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:2e45c2f59eaa336def7b57f3127113fe48acb13d8fef32b86a136e2172eb757e", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 44, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Погоди, через неделю?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000116_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000116_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:8308c03efe4b114cce81800fbfb1f7abd9addd2b23f40bd175d8e58d8b34ad7c", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 45, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "От признания до свадьбы у нас прошла всего неделя?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000119_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000119_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:9bf7b63bce02e7565fb47882eeba623480d12a1f99709fda918c18476ac7a75f", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 46, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Хе-хе, все тоже удивились.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000120_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000120_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:1916b717c5eac42d8fa023b8f3da5b7c485eeb4bd97b090c6c009ce0d69bfd64", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 47, "speaker": null, "translation": "Ещё бы.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000121_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000121_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:be831e6b51d4e1813c881eae65b72bfe74d34287c1f2af93654514a0d377d1b1", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 48, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я сам сейчас в шоке!", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000124_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000124_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ddbe224fa98d9fe4e30bfe93a2514b2474ad39fab3f63c40ab58c88fb3c7c3b6", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 49, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Хе-хе, жизнь словно во сне.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000127_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000127_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:bdfb2ea6bf036b7fa362d2fa2de4b92dbd322824c9171da9e3fa0c068aedeb2f", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 50, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Мы всей семьёй живём вместе.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000130_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000130_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:16ff32e8bdc6bcb91d649ef7306efe6f91719a0f3ac82b6fc73b765e2a44afcd", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 51, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Если это счастье — сон, я не против, чтобы он длился вечно.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000131_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000131_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:8a0372c6906970a2b39c6d8520036331fb0ff0debb28af0bba1446ce8ae86ddd", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 52, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Не против вечно оставаться во сне?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000134_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000134_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:449bd0262378c4223c50f143963f8887f5e47bee79e40ba2e49a7d0f1b1ccdad", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 53, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Если мы счастливы, что в этом плохого? Хаири, ты не согласен?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000135_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000135_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:f3bf2a9fc35bd0da695600da38a877cb8cf97cb3f55d160e4ead2d0677d2e9f8", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 54, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Я…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000136_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000136_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:6897a7de94d92a7e705fdf3f2f4d2406059cdde05a40c48c7884d0ea473a5f52", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 55, "speaker": null, "translation": "Если хорошенько подумать, Номики права.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000137_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000137_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:1bdd852800fe0eba7841140ec8a33279b43ef3ceeac2f84b47b43e6bd4ce2e22", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 56, "speaker": null, "translation": "Мне не просто нечего терять — здесь я смогу всегда быть с Номики.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000138_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000138_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:2bf27e4edc7e40d5f2ea04ce28852d206854bb3d1dd9cdd70f6aa42cc46c1471", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 57, "speaker": null, "translation": "Стоит проснуться, и я снова вернусь к мучительной безответной любви.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000139_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000139_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:af3d4b1546b3fe87c0bc8e1f50c781357197d673cb53b33312010fbeb076c426", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 58, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "…Да, пусть этот сон длится вечно.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000142_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000142_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:f32137ef0dd18f27909faa21a97492d7cf042b668044673a9082ebdf728ced2f", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 59, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Вот именно.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000145_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000145_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:18e4436f8a03339d7ff6f1b1370070e1eecfefaeec13a9850c4807cea4116893", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 60, "speaker": null, "translation": "Номики прижимается ко мне.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000146_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000146_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:e4508fcd5afb815fabc1352a46b22a3e2cb65fa3d625009bcaf534d5c033db9d", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 61, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я без раздумий раскрываю объятия и обнимаю её.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000149_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000149_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ed336cedb062ae7349d518c7d2591336d6a1454973302811459caf5248e62ea3", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 62, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Странно…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000152_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000152_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:b0f79e7b61c2b84f9463379593b8636b6ce0a6d8a0da4c869eab58889a367c8b", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 63, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Температура тела у всех примерно одинаковая. Почему же, касаясь друг друга, мы оба чувствуем тепло?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000155_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000155_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:a50a6c9c61216270bdba6a7c98529a237ff79fac84c7aee271101cdbf691b839", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 64, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Может быть, мы чувствуем тепло человеческого сердца.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000156_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000156_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:0ea0a7f01e0e4566510f9f168e7966ead49aa6d8b92b65c22f75525a436b9116", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 65, "speaker": null, "translation": "Номики говорит это с блаженной улыбкой.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000157_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000157_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:be01dda6e2235cc75c8eac3bb5e7373bcd795f9f6a0e9b306dd7ba6d5da67078", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 66, "speaker": null, "translation": "И правда, в этом тепле есть что-то странное.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000158_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000158_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:6e2118a3dfc44951e9e921bc486b82c8910ae0faac8fa57a99e1345c368a94f5", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 67, "speaker": null, "translation": "Мне хочется вечно оставаться так. Кажется, что я имею на это право.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000159_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000159_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:7af2275ee55d5805ea56c034f25885a34fe627a232da77839bdb5e8899f59a6d", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 68, "speaker": null, "translation": "Пусть даже это сон…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000160_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000160_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ead08f74bf9b2ff0456d359b8f9e34d4afdbeec0eb9393d2ff0846429635372e", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 69, "speaker": null, "translation": "Если я смогу вечно быть рядом с Номики…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000161_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000161_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:73acd571de66d15d2ac81b0f57eca44ff0cf65576cab30af512a2ab187262565", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 70, "speaker": null, "translation": "…Сон…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000162_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000162_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:03f7ba95df89a39356cf0067e770138a34f0e6ca0b3f97a434579d79661f76dc", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 71, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "……", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000163_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000163_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:08c04ed4053ef2b69f3e3ec8b89ee1ee69d85526b9dfc9e63658560c0cb7a981", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 72, "speaker": null, "translation": "Разве сны… видят только во сне?..", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000164_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000164_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:973762e51bdd14d0e008658b48b596440df5dbc684ff7cbb5be5900ae37c2bea", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 73, "speaker": null, "translation": "Есть ведь и важные мечты, которые видишь наяву…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000167_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000167_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:2f3b95c4921215e561618f4f0ad08ae3c451427e054303ba2214af6b8b9ac336", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 74, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Хаири?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000168_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000168_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:c946093e098c82ffe974c647f36b47a4a54aa31690e317f8737430fc1c717ab2", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 75, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Точно, что стало с газетой?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000171_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000171_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:3a5556d00bfc56f086ee10fedf8885a723e98953280dd29542acbd16aa369105", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 76, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Газетой?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000172_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000172_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:a81e3a4e87a0a69f9e88f8f6fb6434db287e6cee93d4abfc7948f33107061d3e", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 77, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "А Туристический дневник?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000175_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000175_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:d49700491d62165626a7f0fe8cf8299f6d28e57a3bfd9353f7d229625d32a635", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 78, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "О чём ты?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000176_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000176_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:bc8a0f611a3c936f7a332839649718881bcaaf7016771a3c021458d70f6da966", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 79, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Но… разве это не твои мечты?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000179_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000179_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:6ffd58cfe19d99296e7fdd243f096360d8fc940593b6bb3ebd73b609e65986b6", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 80, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Мечты?.. Мои?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000180_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000180_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:661b35789a5580959506c75553e6f6986c37d5fb3bccf8530703be8f066e0470", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 81, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Ты же говорила, что хочешь отплатить добром людям острова.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000183_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000183_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:197cc3c736d13c0ef0da0d4e98a2bc008152d9abc058838fdcf9af1a220fe609", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 82, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Отплатить добром… мечты…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000186_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000186_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:758316f7cd076836b82fdad548c34a957a598b8acfacc5ced5ff87464a777b65", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 83, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Хаири, о чём ты? Вот моя мечта.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000189_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000189_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:e5fe3e68beb4d85ef80e8680881d06be902555e35660934f5a78dcff78898c6c", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 84, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Этот миг — моя мечта.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000190_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000190_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:9a046fe1d66ededaa54c1404bfbce514b972e1bac512e07713efa259746de27b", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 85, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Да, но…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000191_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000191_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:a7147c14e928c78d8df83c60e75c8e40adfead38f1262600d0c046708a14ee48", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 86, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "А? Ты тоже понимаешь, что это сон?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000194_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000194_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ee0df1bc1c70121620a199ee5437a36d4436b186dbfc9490f8fa30c4fe3841ea", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 87, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Нет, но если считать его реальностью, он и будет реальностью.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000195_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000195_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ee8a6e51a7d962273ddbb9f2fa78986f9f3949222851ec9673c5022a7a2068eb", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 88, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "М-м…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000196_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000196_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:0681966d5fb59d4f1b70a8db7b5059ebc90dad7f11260cbce86021b2b5b07a55", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 89, "speaker": null, "translation": "Сон и реальность странно переплетаются.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000197_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000197_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:3e46cd1fd3e9b03469a3a648332ba9d092f7562d87b172b4846bd4b951246330", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 90, "speaker": null, "translation": "Это наверняка сон, но часть меня готова признать его реальностью.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000198_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000198_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:e999d05497fd76b71f87eaf04a516d0423520121c0ec13a723041721b737ccf6", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 91, "speaker": null, "translation": "От этих мыслей голова идёт кругом.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000201_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000201_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:f0b4f51f6f763d9d7c764703a98ee130c1752ac379ae3dc14662bace27e02d8b", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 92, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Хаири, может, ещё поспишь?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000202_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000202_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:52d292ef72c74236f07f78f4c77c7930241e2518c38310d11f4279d4a66f1896", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 93, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Нет, мне кажется, здесь лучше не засыпать…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000205_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000205_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:4857625943dd6948540542740661b75f2753f2196205f9200c67cdaa795ab184", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 94, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Всё хорошо, я рядом.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000208_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000208_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:d805c4998f8ad54cd488a1fe9889185ad5b32eefc6d1335156734cbedf3ba10c", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 95, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Я всегда буду так рядом.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000211_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000211_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:777d5e7e0d35760c282422cb0310f271e154c5ec92bcded85e452557b80c2700", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 96, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Мы ведь муж и жена.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000212_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000212_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:46c05c3b968618c51d2cc54df9437e2d89c2e12ff61a67ec43879a818d1b5724", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 97, "speaker": null, "translation": "Она прижимается ещё ближе и маленьким телом обнимает меня изо всех сил.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000213_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000213_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:591d927a3699bb1a9d2dbe2dc049eb60b5e46931e591b5add60f9f858329780e", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 98, "speaker": null, "translation": "Её тепло так приятно, что я не могу сопротивляться наваливающейся сонливости.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000214_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000214_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:2efba9d9fabb6b83261faa6d0efda4801f3a15ab5dab7d4340e740fa15e5be23", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 99, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Номики… п-проснись…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000215_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000215_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:3d75f9bd67ea03c58a38913bc8a6e2e7ef8f80da66f1f411f4ccb1226c67cce1", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 100, "speaker": null, "translation": "К которой из них обращены эти слова?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000216_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000216_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ce52eafb95a6b03c52c1579d48d0c439e2a38f08a83ccbddcb73fe871cbb42b7", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 101, "speaker": null, "translation": "Даже окончание собственной фразы доносится словно издалека.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0301_R000217_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000308_R000217_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:6d89e7ba639790b99e8b8889a71cba36fb13fcf0ad75b1bc2466ee6608a15afb", "file_id": "S0301", "scene_id": "SCN0290", "order": 102, "speaker": null, "translation": "И моё сознание внезапно гаснет.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
